  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution of Avicenna to the World Science</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ibn Sina Public Foundation has introduced scientific platforms such as traditional international scientific and practical conferences on pharmaceuticals, traditional medicine, sciences and the celebration of Avicenna&amp;#39;s birthdays. The purpose of the event is to study in-depth and widen promotion of the rich heritage left to mankind by the doctor, scientist and philosopher Abu Ali ibn Sina, who made an invaluable contribution to the world medicine, education of our compatriots, and especially young people, on the basis of his spiritual and educational heritage, wide familiarization with this universal heritage of foreign citizens and activation of reforms in the system health care.</narrative>
  </description>
